<p>Those affected by your Nihil find themselves increasingly removed from reality, reducing all damage they deal by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 1%, 2%, 2%, 3%</acronym> and causing them to take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11, 15, 18, 20, 23</acronym> temporal damage each turn for each negative magical effect they have.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>